832
01:06:26.731 --> 01:06:28.698
And I told you that
I'd finish out the shift.

833
01:06:28.700 --> 01:06:30.867
Yeah, I appreciate it.
But look, you're not obligated.

834
01:06:30.869 --> 01:06:33.405
- I have done it with...
- My word is an obligation.

835
